      "overall_rating": 0,
      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "The quote was provided quickly and was easy to understand. We wanted a higher quality panel and found many were not able to/wanted to provide and were trying to get us to settle for a cheaper product, but we had researched the panels we wanted and SEQ solar were happy to oblige. The installation was completed quickly and our property was left clean and tidy at the end. We upgraded to 3 phase for our EV charging station and this was troublesome because of waiting and dealing with Energex. SEQ were able to make all the necessary upgrades to our mains and worked with Energex directly to ensure that our property was compliant. I am confident that SEQ went above and beyond for my family to ensure that we had the system we wanted and we didn't need to remortgage the house to pay for it. Highly recommend Tim and the SEQ team. I have added some images from my new drone to show their workmanship.",
