      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "My request for an EV charger was answered by his representative, who relayed the info to the director. The same director supplied the initial quote and offered contact via mobile or email address. The first price was comprehensive, gave me all the information I required to move forwards, and, after more research, supported my belief that top-notch components were combined with a top EV charger. The director, who also finished the quotation amendments to include a myenergi hub, extra CT Clamp, longer charging cable etc. He also satisfactorily responded to all of my questions. Comparatively speaking, the rival supplied me an EV Charger and a lower price, but it wasn't sufficient for my needs. I'm happy with my purchase overall, especially with the director's help in clarifying warranty registration and his follow-up with the manufacturer after a professional supply and installation. In summary, the director exhibited all the qualities of a great sparky; honesty, professionalism, contactable, prompt response and patience.EV Charger: Zappi Version 2EV Cable length: 7m 7kW",
