      "review_description": "Spoke directly with the director, he was able to quote quickly, no sales pitch, felt like an honest guy. The big differentiator was that I needed some extra work to fix my fans and he put in a great price for those, the competition said they would \"do a deal\" and what they came back with was pretty unreasonable. I followed my gut by going with this company despite no reviews here, but based on my interactions with other companies, there was an air of honesty that appealed. The quote was professional and had all the information you'd expect, best of all, installation was available the following week!Installers came on a ridiculously hot day, got the job done with no dramas, including the fan controllers.The setup of the invertor and connection to the grid was smooth. Very happy overall.",
